@startuml ContextDiagram
skinparam Style strictuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Client\n(Browser / Mobile)" as Client

component "Horse Racing API\n(ASP.NET Core 8)" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n(Neon)" as DB
component "Cloudinary\n(Image Storage)" as Cloudinary
component "VNPay\n(Payment Gateway)" as VNPay
component "Railway\n(Hosting)" as Railway
component "GitHub Actions\n(CI / CD)" as CI

Client --> API : HTTPS / REST JSON

API --> DB : EF Core (DB First)
API --> Cloudinary : Upload ảnh
API --> VNPay : Webhook xác nhận thanh toán

CI --> Railway : Auto deploy\n(push to dev)
Railway --> API : Host container\n(Docker)

@enduml
